━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ Duration is F64

────────────────────
+ to Broadcastable'Seconds

interval'Seconds()

────────────────────
+ to CTimeSpec

CTimeSpec(s, ns)

.. nd = modf(this as Seconds)
.. s = nd[0] as CSeconds
.. ns = (nd[1] * 1000 * 1000 * 1000) as CNanoseconds

` ====================================================================================================
` + Range ...
`     _ Duration Duration
`
