` + to Iterable'Seconds
`
` interval'Seconds()

────────────────────
+ do wait

. sem = Semaphore()
. canceled = C:yumiSuspendActiveTaskUntilTime(this as Microseconds, sem.native-pointer)
check-task-cancelation(canceled)

= this

────────────────────
+ do freeze

. spec = this as CTimeSpec
C:yumiGCEnterFFI()
do C:nanosleep(&spec, null)
C:yumiGCLeaveFFI()

────────────────────
+ do loop
    - with Doer

. loop = TimerLoop()
do new loop.loop(this, with)
= loop

────────────────────
+ animation-loop
    - with Doer

AnimationLoop(this, with)

────────────────────
+ interval'Interval

Timer(this as Interval)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

+ Nanoseconds (ns)              is Duration
+ Microseconds (µs)             is 1000ns
+ Milliseconds (ms)             is 1000µs
+ Seconds (s, seconds)          is 1000ms
+ Minutes (minutes)             is 60s
+ Hours (hours)                 is 60minutes
+ Days (days)                   is 24hours
+ Weeks (weeks)                 is 7days

` These intervals are approximations since not all months or years have the same length
+ Months (months)               is 31days
+ Years (years)                 is 365days
+ Decades (decades)             is 10years
+ Centuries (centuries)         is 100years
+ Milleniums (milleniums)       is 1000years

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

+ 1csec = 1000000000cnsec
+ 1csec = 1seconds
+ 1cnsec = 1ns

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ do timeout'Item
    - stream <Item>

for message in stream
    <= message
    break
or t in this
    <= TimeoutError()

<<= stream
